        "description": "Twarangije igitabo ca Hagayi tubonye ingene Kristo umwami w'abami azoganza amahanga yose. Twabonye kandi ko iki gitabu kirimwo ubutumwa bukomeye butumenyesha ivy'ibihe vy'iherezo.Iki gitabo kandi canditswe mu bihe bigoye aho Ab'Isirayeli bari bafise ingorane nyinshi cane.Bari babayeho ata mugisha , ata munezero kubera ko bari bararetse ingoro y'Imana ikaguma ihomvaguritse ariko kubera urukundo rwayo yaraberetse icatumye babura umugisha ica ibereka rero n'ico bokora icishije mu wavugishwa n'Imana Hagayi ngo bamenye ko ico ibagombako ari kuyigororokera. Ibindi vyose vyoba ari impfagusa.",
