        "description": "Ubuheruka twumvise intangamarara y'igitabo ca Hagayi. Uwo Hagayi twumvise ko ari umwe mu bavugishwa n'Imana batanze ubutumwa bwo guhimiriza Ab'Isirayeli batahutse bava mu kinyago ngo basanure urusengero rw'Imana. Imvugo ya Hagayi yari imvugo y'umukozi w'Imana aciye bugufi, yakunda gukoresha ijambo rivuga ngo :uku niko Uhoraho agize kuko yashikiriza abantu ivyo Uhoraho amuhaye. Mu ntangamarara rero niho twumvise yuko Hagayi yashikirije ubutumwa bwo gusanura urusengero no gusubira kurushiramwo ibikoresho.",
